       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ACCTVAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-ACCOUNT PIC X(10).
       01 WS-I PIC 99.
       01 WS-VALID PIC X VALUE 'Y'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER ACCOUNT NUMBER: "
           ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT

           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-I > 10
               IF WS-ACCOUNT(WS-I:1) < '0'
                   OR WS-ACCOUNT(WS-I:1) > '9'
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-VALID
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM

           IF WS-VALID = 'Y'
               DISPLAY "VALID"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "INVALID"
           END-IF

           STOP RUN.

